#: source/setup/demos.rst:9
msgid "Demos"
msgstr "演示"

#: source/setup/demos.rst:11
msgid ""
"Demos are polished showcases of Isaac Lab capabilities. They ship in the "
"``isaaclab`` wheel, so you can run them without a source checkout. Start "
"with Zoo to see several robot families and simulation features in one scene,"
" or run ``uvx --torch-backend cu130 isaaclab demo list`` to inspect the "
"complete catalog."
msgstr ""
"演示用于集中展示 Isaac Lab 的能力，随 ``isaaclab`` wheel 一同提供，无需检出源码即可运行。可以先运行 "
"Zoo，在同一场景中查看多个机器人系列和仿真功能；也可以用 ``uvx --torch-backend cu130 isaaclab demo "
"list`` 查看完整列表。"

#: source/setup/demos.rst:15
msgid ""
"All programs live under the repository-level ``examples/`` directory: "
"curated showcases in ``examples/demos/``, focused programs for learning an "
"API or tuning a feature in directories such as ``examples/mpm/`` and "
"``examples/sensors/``, and shared data in ``examples/assets/``. List focused"
" programs with ``uvx --torch-backend cu130 isaaclab example list`` and run "
"one with ``uvx --torch-backend cu130 isaaclab example <name>``."
msgstr ""
"所有程序都位于仓库根目录下的 ``examples/``：集中展示功能的演示位于 ``examples/demos/``，用于学习单个 API "
"或调试特定功能的示例位于 ``examples/mpm/``、``examples/sensors/`` 等目录，共用数据位于 "
"``examples/assets/``。用 ``uvx --torch-backend cu130 isaaclab example list`` "
"列出专题示例，再用 ``uvx --torch-backend cu130 isaaclab example <name>`` 运行。"

#: source/setup/demos.rst:21
msgid ""
"Demo and example commands show the same Isaac Lab startup screen as task "
"playback while their simulation initializes. Pass ``--info`` to keep startup"
" messages visible."
msgstr "演示和示例命令在仿真初始化期间，会显示与任务策略运行相同的 Isaac Lab 启动画面。添加 ``--info`` 可保留启动信息。"

#: source/setup/demos.rst:24
msgid ""
"Unlike ``train`` and ``play``, demos and examples usually open a visualizer "
"by default, since they are meant to be watched. Demos mostly default to "
"Newton GL (``newton_gl``), with Kit for some such as ``pick-and-place``. The"
" ``h1-locomotion`` demo defaults to Kit with PhysX and Newton GL with "
"Newton. Examples default to Kit or Newton GL depending on the program, and a"
" few, such as ``ppisp-camera`` and ``tacsl-sensor``, run without a "
"visualizer. Pass ``--viz`` to pick a different one."
msgstr ""
"演示和示例用于直观查看运行效果，通常默认打开可视化器，这与 ``train`` 和 ``play`` 不同。大部分演示默认使用 Newton "
"GL（``newton_gl``）；``pick-and-place`` 等部分演示使用 Kit。``h1-locomotion`` 演示在 PhysX"
" 后端默认使用 Kit，在 Newton 后端默认使用 Newton GL。示例根据程序默认使用 Kit 或 Newton GL；``ppisp-"
"camera``、``tacsl-sensor`` 等少数示例不使用可视化器。可通过 ``--viz`` 选择其他可视化器。"

#: source/setup/demos.rst:30
msgid ""
"In any packaged demo or example running with ``--viz newton_gl``, the "
"**Isaac Lab Programs** panel shows the core showcases first, with focused "
"examples in a separate collapsed section. Selecting one closes the current "
"simulation and relaunches it with ``--viz newton_gl``. For example, run "
"``uvx --torch-backend cu130 isaaclab demo zoo --viz newton_gl`` to explore "
"the catalog. Programs whose required modules are unavailable, hardware-"
"dependent teleoperation, and Kit-only demos are not shown."
msgstr ""
"随包提供的演示或示例使用 ``--viz newton_gl`` 运行时，**Isaac Lab Programs** "
"面板会先列出核心演示，专题示例则放在单独的折叠区域。选择一项后，当前仿真会关闭，再以 ``--viz newton_gl`` "
"重新启动所选程序。例如，可以运行 ``uvx --torch-backend cu130 isaaclab demo zoo --viz "
"newton_gl`` 来浏览列表。缺少所需模块的程序、依赖硬件的遥操作程序，以及只能使用 Kit 的演示不会显示。"

#: source/setup/demos.rst:37
msgid ""
"For particle-material comparisons and solver guidance, see :ref:`newton-"
"tuning-mpm`."
msgstr "粒子材料比较和求解器使用说明见 :ref:`newton-tuning-mpm` 。"

